            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1>Charge Your EV With Confidence</h1>
                <p>Never wait for a charging station again. ChargeNow lets you reserve EV charging stations in advance, ensuring your vehicle is always powered when you need it.</p>
                <div class="cta-buttons">
                    <a href="/login" class="btn">Reserve a Station</a>
                    <!--<a href="#" class="btn btn-outlined">Download App</a>-->
